{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00490","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 四 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜如何其，明星煌煌。\n天清容卫，露结坛场。\n树羽幢幢，佩玉锵锵。\n凝精驻目，瞻望神光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}